# Everything the image does not need. Keeps the build context small and, more to the point, keeps
# local secrets and virtualenvs out of it — a .env copied into a layer is a secret in the image.
**/.env
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
.git
.gitignore
Claude/
docs/
*.md
er-diagram.py
